msgstr "Roghnaítear leanaí an chaidrimh seo ar an gcluaisín Ginearálta."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1268
msgid "The default is %s, which means that reauthentication is off."
msgstr ""
"Is é %s an réamhshocrú, rud a chiallaíonn go bhfuil athfhíordheimhniú múchta."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:83
#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/secrets.js:81
#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:245
msgid "The file \"%s\" does not exist."
msgstr "Níl an comhad \"%s\" ann."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:115
msgid ""
"The hash is omitted for authenticated encryption (AEAD) algorithms. The PRF "
"is used for IKE proposals only."
msgstr ""
"Fágtar an hais ar lár i gcás algartam criptithe fíordheimhnithe (AEAD). Ní "
"úsáidtear an PRF ach amháin i gcás tograí IKE."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1370
msgid ""
"The locals of this connection and their order are selected on the "
"Authentication tab."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaítear na heilimintí áitiúla den nasc seo agus an t-ord atá orthu ar an "
"gcluaisín Fíordheimhnithe."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/log.js:44
