msgid "The mask defaults to 0xffffffff."
msgstr "Is é 0xffffffff an luach réamhshocraithe don masc."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:929
msgid "The migration may require manual intervention."
msgstr "D’fhéadfadh idirghabháil láimhe a bheith ag teastáil ón imirce."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:212
msgid ""
"The name of the section is the name of the pool, under which a connection "
"refers to it."
msgstr ""
"Is é ainm an ailt ná ainm an linn, a ndéanann nasc tagairt dó faoina ainm."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1136
#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1170
msgid "The order matters: the sections are used in the order they are listed."
msgstr ""
"Tá tábhacht leis an ord: úsáidtear na rannáin san ord ina bhfuil siad "
"liostaithe."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:232
msgid ""
"The peers use them to resolve names while the tunnel is up, e.g. for hosts "
"in the remote network."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann na piaraí iad chun ainmneacha a réiteach fad is atá an tollán "
"gníomhach, m.sh. i gcás óstach sa líonra iargúlta."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1375
msgid ""
"The remotes of this connection and their order are selected on the "
"Authentication tab."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaítear na cianphointí don nasc seo, chomh maith lena n-ord, ar an "
"gcluaisín Fíordheimhnithe."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1434
msgid ""
"The string is used verbatim as the proposal instead of the assembled one."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an teaghrán focal ar fhocal mar an togra, in áit an chinn a "
"cuireadh le chéile."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:930
msgid "Therefore, the VPN is not restarted."
msgstr "Dá bhrí sin, ní dhéantar an VPN a atosú."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:200
msgid "These are usually http URLs."
msgstr "Is URLanna http iad seo de ghnáth."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1284
msgid ""
"This makes the peer believe that a NAT situation exist on the transmission "
"path, forcing it to encapsulate ESP packets in UDP."
msgstr ""
"Fágann sé seo go gcreideann an piaraí go bhfuil cás NAT ann ar an gcosán "
"tarchuir, rud a chuireann iallach air paicéid ESP a ionchopláil in UDP."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:306
msgid ""
"This option must be enabled in the service configuration (Netlink Settings) "
"for routes to be set automatically."
msgstr ""
"Caithfear an rogha seo a chumasú i gcumraíocht na seirbhíse (Socruithe "
"Netlink) chun go socrófar bealaí go huathoibríoch."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/strongswan.js:133
msgid "Time format"
msgstr "Formáid ama"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1275
msgid ""
"Time range from which to choose a random value to subtract from the rekey "
"and reauthentication times."
msgstr ""
"Raon ama ar féidir luach randamach a roghnú as, le dealú ó na hamanna "
"atheochrach agus athfhíordheimhnithe."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:392
msgid ""
"Time range from which to choose a random value to subtract from the rekey "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Raon ama as ar féidir luach randamach a roghnú le dealú ón am atheochrachais."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1248
msgid "Timeout to close connection if no response to DPD is received."
msgstr "Teorainn ama chun an nasc a dhúnadh mura bhfaightear freagra ar DPD."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1283
msgid ""
"To enforce UDP encapsulation of ESP packets, the IKE daemon can manipulate "
"the NAT detection payloads."
msgstr ""
"Chun ionchorprú UDP ar phaicéid ESP a fhorfheidhmiú, is féidir leis an "
"daemon IKE na hualaí braite NAT a ionramháil."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:270
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Iompar"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/strongswan.js:40
msgid "Trusted Network Connect"
msgstr "Ceangal Líonra Iontaofa"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:269
msgid "Tunnel"
msgstr "Tollán"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/secrets.js:109
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Cineál"

